  "keyFeatures": [
    "Multi-provider AI translation: Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic, Groq, DeepInfra, Together AI, and local Ollama",
    "Both CLI (Click-based) and GUI (ttkbootstrap) interfaces",
    "Project-based workflow with per-project settings and file paths",
    "Automated pipeline: extract strings → translate in chunks → normalize → export",
    "Automatic API key rotation and retry logic for resilience",
    "Post-processing: normalizer, void cleaner, manual edit workflow",
    "UndertaleModTool (UMT) integration for extracting/reinserting data.win strings",
    "Special command preservation (\\XX, $~X, ~X, ^X) during translation"
  ],
